/T (2. Istitlaa \(Public Consultation\) Dataset Steps Performed  1. Loaded the dataset \(istitlaa_laborlaw.csv\) using UTF-8-SIG encoding.  2. Duplicates were removed using drop_duplicates\(\).  3. Missing values were replaced with "N/A".  4. Applied the same clean_text\(\) function used in BOE cleaning to standardize and normalize all text fields.  5. Exported the cleaned data as istitlaa_cleaned.csv.)
/E (2. Istitlaa \(Public Consultation\) Dataset Steps Performed  1. Loaded the dataset \(istitlaa_laborlaw.csv\) using UTF-8-SIG encoding.  2. Duplicates were removed using drop_duplicates\(\).  3. Missing values were replaced with "N/A".  4. Applied the same clean_text\(\) function used in BOE cleaning to standardize and normalize all text fields.  5. Exported the cleaned data as istitlaa_cleaned.csv.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
